  "description": "This walk visits Lickeen Lough in The Burren of County Clare. The lake is located a few miles east of the town of Ennistymon. At the western end of the lake there is a country lane running along the lakeside. Here you can enjoy a peaceful stroll with some lovely views across the water to the surrounding countryside.You can continue your walking in the area on theEnnistymon Falls Walk.",
